6. PROJECT NAME
======================================================================

The word "Flux" must remain part of the project name.

Forks may append additional identifiers but may not remove "Flux"
entirely.

Examples:

✓ Flux Community Edition
✓ Flux – John's Fork
✓ Flux Enhanced

Not permitted:

✗ Habit Hero
✗ My Productivity App
✗ Better Habits

